   * This operation provides advanced search functionality for user management, allowing filtering by email address, display name patterns, and account status (active or deleted). The response includes user summary information suitable for administrative interfaces and user management screens.
   *
   * Access to this operation is restricted based on user permissions. Regular authenticated users can only retrieve their own user information, while administrative users may have broader access privileges. All responses adhere to the application's strict privacy policies ensuring user data remains protected.
   *
   * The pagination system supports both page-based and cursor-based navigation for efficient browsing of user lists. Response includes metadata about total result counts and pagination state for seamless user interface integration.
   *
   * @param connection
   * @param body Search criteria and pagination parameters for user listing
   * @x-autobe-authorization-type null
   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor null
   * @x-autobe-specification Query todo_app_users table with pagination and filtering capabilities. Apply search filters on email, display_name, and account status (active/deleted). Return cursor-based pagination for large result sets. Always filter by the requesting user's permissions - regular users should only see their own data, while admin users may see all users. Include proper access control checks to prevent unauthorized data access.
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
   */
  @TypedRoute.Patch()
  public async index(
    @TypedBody()
